---
---
<section class="section section--subtle" id="about" data-num="01">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about__grid" data-reveal>
      <div class="about__content">
        <span class="section__label">About Us</span>
        <h2 class="section__title">Established in 2014,<br/>Building Trust Ever Since</h2>
        <p class="about__text">
          Founded by <strong>Mr. E.A. Malik (Director - Tech)</strong> in I.P. Extension, New Delhi, ARSM Engineering & Technology
          has grown from a small workshop to a trusted name in crushing, conveying & screening solutions.
        </p>
        <p class="about__text">
          As a proprietorship firm with a team of <strong>10+ skilled professionals</strong>, we manufacture
          and supply belt conveyors, jaw crushers, vibrating screens, screw conveyors, coal crushers, crushing plants,
          grinding mills, sand washing plants, chain conveyors, bucket elevators, and complete material handling systems
          to clients across India. Our products are built to last and priced to deliver real value.
        </p>
        <div class="about__features">
          <div class="about__feature">
            <i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill"></i>
            <span>GST Registered Business</span>
          </div>
          <div class="about__feature">
            <i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill"></i>
            <span>30+ Product Categories</span>
          </div>
          <div class="about__feature">
            <i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill"></i>
            <span>Pan-India Client Base</span>
          </div>
          <div class="about__feature">
            <i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill"></i>
            <span>Founded 2014 · Director: Mr. E.A. Malik</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about__grid {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about__text {
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    color: var(--body);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-3);
  }

  .about__text strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about__features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-2);
    margin-top: var(--sp-4);
  }

  .about__feature {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .about__feature i {
    color: var(--success);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .about__features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
